module intent-lens
  Square roots by Newton's method.

newton_sqrt  @76f8d5b9
  what  The square root of a, to an absolute residual tol.
  how   Newton's iteration on x^2 - a, which averages x and a / x.
  why   Each pass doubles the number of correct digits once x is close to the root.
  a     the number whose root is wanted
  tol   the largest accepted |x^2 - a|
  x     the current estimate of the root

  guess     start from the number itself
  repeat until x * x is within tol of a
    update  average x and a / x
